Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:51:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] lineage-sdk: name ExpressiveOS in the system strings

ExpressiveOS is its own ROM: the About phone version, API level and
updates labels, the system label and several translated permission
descriptions still named Evolution X (or LineageOS in a few
translations).

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
